						}
					}
					title: "Any #tfc:firepit_sticks"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Getting Started"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3FD56221E3C69A6A"]
			description: [
				" Once you have a number of rocks and sticks, you are ready to start Knapping. Knapping is a process where two rocks are hit together, to form a particular shape. In order to knap, first hold at least two rocks in your hand, then right click in the air, which will open up the Knapping Interface. In order to knap a particular item, you want to remove squares until you form the desired pattern. The patterns for each stone head can be found in the JEI menu."
				""
				"All stone tool heads can be crafted with a stick or twig to assemble them into a tool."
			]
			id: "270DA708118B3F22"
			subtitle: "You're such a tool"
			tasks: [{
				id: "78EED52236A869EC"
				item: {
					Count: 1
