		{
			dependencies: ["751E9D895BBC81CD"]
			description: [
				"Like with rocks, clay can be knapped to form new items. It requires five clay in your hand to knap. Unlike rocks, if you make a mistake, you can simply close the knapping interface, reshape your clay, and try again."
				""
				"The small vessel is one such item. Like all pottery items, it must be fired before it can be used. Firing is a process of heating the item up to a point where the clay will turn into a hard Ceramic material, which requires heating to 1400 °C, or &eYellow White&r."
				""
				"[ \"In order to do this in the early game, you will need to use a \", { \"text\": \"Pit Kiln.\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"71E73C4F58FAFCEE\" } } ]"
			]
			id: "565A36BF9530B684"
			subtitle: "Kidnap clay, I think"
			tasks: [{
				id: "63B8C6E6F4824BD4"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					ForgeCaps: {
						"tfc:item_heat": {
							heat: 0.0f
							ticks: 0L
						}
					}
					id: "tfc:ceramic/unfired_vessel"
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Clay Knapping"
			x: -1.5d
			y: -10.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"794629112DA3198B"
				"1F978FF0139B8FEC"
				"0746C39E079E1B36"
			]
			description: [
				"A pit kiln is an early game method of heating items up. It can be used to fire clay into ceramic, for example. The pit kiln, over the time period of about eight hours, will heat its contents up to 1400 °C, or &eYellow White&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"In order to create a pit kiln:"
				""
				"1. Place up to four items down in a 1x1 hole with V."
				"2. Use eight Straw on the pit kiln, until the items are covered."
				"3. Use eight Logs on the pit kiln, until full."
				"4. Light the top of the pit kiln on fire!"
				""
				"The pit kiln will then burn for eight hours, slowly heating the items inside up."
				""
				"To pick hot things up out of a pit kiln you will need to make Tongs."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:campfire"
			id: "71E73C4F58FAFCEE"
			subtitle: "Fire!"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "2B07D31F61C7A94A"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "itemfilters:tag"
						tag: {
							value: "tfc:pit_kiln_straw"
